---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import avatar from "../assets/images/avatar.png";
---

<div id="left-intro">
  <div id="intro-heading">
    Hi there. I'm <span class="accent">Marina</span>, <br />a
    Senior <span class="accent">UX Writer</span> at Turnitin.
  </div>
  <div id="intro-description">
    <p>
      I design content systems that make complex information easier to understand and use. My work spans UX copy, documentation, and the processes that support them, helping teams scale content without losing clarity.</p>

    <p>I care about making information usable, reducing friction, and helping people work smarter.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="right-intro">
  <div id="intro-image">
    <Image src={avatar} alt="A graphic of Marina" />
  </div>
</div>
